# Marketing art and the brand shape set are made and iterated on locally, and a
# single thumbnail is ~2 MB. They were partly tracked and partly ignored, which
# meant the rule below read as "ignore marketing" while the repo carried 6 MB of
# it, and any new final dropped in here went missing from `git status` in
# silence. Both are out of the repo now and live on disk and in the places they
# were made for: the App Store screenshots regenerate from
# `integration_test/screenshots_test.dart`, and the gallery is on Devpost.
#
# `assets/brand/runway-icon-1024.png` stays tracked and is the one exception. It
# is declared in `app/pubspec.yaml`, loaded at runtime by `dashboard_screen`, and
# every launcher icon is generated from it by `make gen-icons`, which fails
# outright if it is missing.
assets/marketing/
assets/brand/shapes/
